   "q": "<p>Ece, Şekil I’deki ABC üçgeni biçimindeki kâğıdı B köşesi C köşesinin tam üzerine gelecek biçimde katlıyor. Kat izinin [BC] kenarını kestiği noktayı D olarak işaretliyor (Şekil II). Sonra kâğıdı açıp [AD] boyunca keserek Şekil III’teki iki üçgen parçayı elde ediyor.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 200\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Şekil I’de ABC üçgeni kâğıt, Şekil II’de B köşesi C’nin üzerine katlanmış kâğıt ve D noktasında [BC]’yi kesen kat izi, Şekil III’te [AD] boyunca kesilerek elde edilen ABD ve ADC parçaları\"><polygon points=\"145.5,70.1 15,150 159,150\" fill=\"#dbeafe\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"145.5\" y=\"62.1\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">A</text><text x=\"9\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">B</text><text x=\"165\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">C</text><text x=\"87\" y=\"192\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">Şekil I</text><polygon points=\"200,150 272,150 272,105.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><polygon points=\"272,150 344,150 330.5,70.1 272,105.9\" fill=\"#dbeafe\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"272,150 344,150 272,105.9\" fill=\"#fdba74\" stroke=\"#c2410c\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"272\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"272\" y2=\"105.9\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"330.5\" y=\"62.1\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">A</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">D</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">C</text><text x=\"354\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#c2410c\">B</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"97\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" font-weight=\"bold\">kat izi</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"192\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">Şekil II</text><polygon points=\"525.5,70.1 395,150 467,150\" fill=\"#dbeafe\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"549.5,70.1 491,150 563,150\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"520.5\" y=\"62.1\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">A</text><text x=\"389\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">B</text><text x=\"467\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">D</text><text x=\"554.5\" y=\"62.1\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">A</text><text x=\"491\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">D</text><text x=\"569\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">C</text><text x=\"479\" y=\"192\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">Şekil III</text></svg></div><ul><li>ABC üçgeninin çevresi 42 cm ve |BC| = 16 cm’dir.</li><li>B köşesini içeren parçanın çevresi 36 cm, C köşesini içeren parçanın çevresi 28 cm’dir.</li></ul><p><b>Buna göre |AB| kaç santimetredir?</b></p>",
