   "a": "A",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Birim kare = 1 km</li> <li>Şekilden: A(1, 1), B(5, 3), C(3, 7)</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>I, II, III ifadelerinden doğru olanlar</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Kenarları Pisagor ile bul</b> Her kenar, yatay ve düşey farkları dik kenar olan bir dik üçgenin hipotenüsüdür. <span class=\"sv-m\">|AB|² = 4² + 2² = 20 → |AB| = 2√5</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">|BC|² = 2² + 4² = 20 → |BC| = 2√5</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">|AC|² = 2² + 6² = 40 → |AC| = 2√10</span></li> <li><b>I’i incele</b> |AB| = |BC| = 2√5 olduğundan I doğrudur.</li> <li><b>II’yi incele</b> Pisagor’un tersine bakalım: 20 + 20 = 40, yani |AB|² + |BC|² = |AC|². Üçgen diktir ama dik açı en uzun kenar [AC]’nin karşısındaki <b>B</b> köşesindedir. II yanlıştır.</li> <li><b>III’ü incele</b> |AC| = 2√10 km’dir; 4√5 ise |AB| + |BC| toplamıdır. III yanlıştır.</li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 330 310\" width=\"330\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Koordinat düzleminde A(1,1), B(5,3), C(3,7); AB ve BC 2√5, AC 2√10, B’de dik açı\"><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"98\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"98\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"132\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"132\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"166\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"166\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"234\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"234\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"268\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"268\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"302\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"52\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"154\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"188\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"188\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"222\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"222\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"256\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"256\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"290\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"64,256 200,188 132,52\" fill=\"#e0f2fe\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polyline points=\"189.3,193.4 183.9,182.6 194.6,177.3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"128.9\" y1=\"215.7\" x2=\"135.1\" y2=\"228.3\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"159.7\" y1=\"123.1\" x2=\"172.3\" y2=\"116.9\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"64\" cy=\"256\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"188\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><circle cx=\"132\" cy=\"52\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"278.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">A(1, 1)</text><text x=\"238\" y=\"192.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">B(5, 3)</text><text x=\"132\" y=\"41.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">C(3, 7)</text><text x=\"138.3\" y=\"239.1\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" font-weight=\"bold\">2√5</text><text x=\"138.3\" y=\"239.1\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0e7490\" font-weight=\"bold\">2√5</text><text x=\"180.3\" y=\"117.4\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" font-weight=\"bold\">2√5</text><text x=\"180.3\" y=\"117.4\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0e7490\" font-weight=\"bold\">2√5</text><text x=\"80.9\" y=\"152.9\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" font-weight=\"bold\">2√10</text><text x=\"80.9\" y=\"152.9\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" font-weight=\"bold\">2√10</text></svg><figcaption>Dik açı B’de; [AC] hipotenüs.</figcaption></figure><table class=\"sv-c\"><tr class=\"ok\"><td>A</td><td>Yalnız I doğru.</td></tr><tr><td>B</td><td>II yanlış (dik açı B’de).</td></tr><tr><td>C</td><td>III yanlış (|AC| = 2√10).</td></tr><tr><td>D</td><td>II ve III yanlış.</td></tr></table><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Dik açı, her zaman en uzun kenarın (hipotenüsün) karşısındaki köşededir.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Dik üçgen olduğunu görüp dik açıyı yanlış köşeye koymak; hipotenüsü iki dik kenarın toplamı sanmak (4√5).</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>A</b></div></div>"
