   "a": "D",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Düzgün altıgen ABCDEF, kenar 4 m</li> <li>Köprüler A, C, E köşelerini birleştiriyor</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Köprülerin toplam uzunluğu (ACE’nin çevresi)</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>ABC üçgenini tanı</b> Düzgün altıgenin her iç açısı 120°’dir. ABC’de |AB| = |BC| = 4 ve s(B) = 120°; üçgen ikizkenardır.</li> <li><b>B’den [AC]’ye dikme in</b> Dikme hem açıortay hem kenarortaydır; 120° ikiye bölünür ve iki tane 30°-60°-90° üçgeni oluşur. Bu üçgenler, kenarı 4 olan eşkenar üçgenin yarısıdır. <span class=\"sv-m\">dikme = 4 ÷ 2 = 2</span></li> <li><b>|AC|’nin yarısını Pisagor ile bul</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">yarım² = 4² − 2² = 12 → yarım = √12 = 2√3</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">|AC| = 4√3 m</span></li> <li><b>Çevreyi hesapla</b> Simetri nedeniyle |AC| = |CE| = |EA|; ACE eşkenar üçgendir. <span class=\"sv-m\">3 · 4√3 = 12√3 m</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 380 270\" width=\"380\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Düzgün altıgen, kenar 4; ACE eşkenar üçgeni; B açısı 120, B’den AC’ye dikme 2, AC’nin yarısı 2√3\"><polygon points=\"86,135 138,44.9 242,44.9 294,135 242,225.1 138,225.1\" fill=\"#e0f2fe\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"86,135 242,44.9 242,225.1\" fill=\"#fde68a\" fill-opacity=\"0.6\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"140.2\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">A</text><text x=\"130.5\" y=\"37.2\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">B</text><text x=\"249.5\" y=\"37.2\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">C</text><text x=\"309\" y=\"140.2\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">D</text><text x=\"249.5\" y=\"243.3\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">E</text><text x=\"130.5\" y=\"243.3\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">F</text><line x1=\"138\" y1=\"44.9\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><polyline points=\"160,83 166.9,79 170.9,86\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M156,44.9 A18,18 0 0,1 129,60.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"101.6\" y=\"88.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" font-weight=\"bold\">4</text><text x=\"101.6\" y=\"88.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">4</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"37.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" font-weight=\"bold\">4</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"37.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">4</text><text x=\"182\" y=\"84.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" font-weight=\"bold\">2√3</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#dc2626\" font-weight=\"bold\">2√3</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"169.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" font-weight=\"bold\">4√3</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"169.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#dc2626\" font-weight=\"bold\">4√3</text></svg><figcaption>B’deki açı 120°; ABC’nin yarısı 30°-60°-90° üçgeni: 2 – 2√3 – 4.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Kenarı a olan düzgün altıgende bir köşe atlayarak çizilen köşegen a√3’tür.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> 4√3 tek köprüdür; 8√3 iki köprünün toplamı, 6√3 yarım köşegenin 3 katıdır.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>D</b></div></div>"
