   "lv": "zor",
   "q": "<p>Bir bölgenin haritası, birim karelerinin kenar uzunluğu 1 km olan koordinat düzleminde modellenmiştir. A(1, 1) ve B(7, 9) noktalarını birleştiren düz bir yol vardır. C(8, 2) noktasındaki evden bu yola dik ve düz bir patika yapılacaktır.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 330 330\" width=\"330\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Koordinat düzlemi; A(1, 1) ve B(7, 9) noktalarını birleştiren düz yol; C(8, 2) noktasında ev\"><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"68\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"68\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"96\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"124\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"124\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"152\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"152\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"208\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"208\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"236\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"236\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"264\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"264\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"292\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"292\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"48\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"104\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"188\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"188\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"216\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"216\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"244\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"244\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"272\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"272\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"316\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0</text><text x=\"96\" y=\"316\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"248\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2</text><text x=\"152\" y=\"316\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">4</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"192\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">4</text><text x=\"208\" y=\"316\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">6</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">6</text><text x=\"264\" y=\"316\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">8</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">8</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"316\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">10</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">10</text><line x1=\"68\" y1=\"272\" x2=\"236\" y2=\"48\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"6\"/><line x1=\"68\" y1=\"272\" x2=\"236\" y2=\"48\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 5\"/><circle cx=\"68\" cy=\"272\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\"/><circle cx=\"236\" cy=\"48\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\"/><text x=\"64\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">A</text><text x=\"248\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">B</text><polygon points=\"255,251 273,251 273,240 264,232 255,240\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"278\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">C</text></svg></div><p><b>Buna göre yapılacak patikanın uzunluğu kaç kilometredir?</b></p>",
