   "a": "B",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>İkizkenar ABC: |AB| = |AC| = 25 m, |BC| = 40 m</li> <li>[AD] ⊥ [BC]; [DE] ⊥ [AB], [DG] ⊥ [AC]</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>|AD| + |DE| + |DG|</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>|AD|’yi bul</b> İkizkenarda tepeden inen dikme tabanı ortalar. <span class=\"sv-m\">|BD| = 20</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">|AD|² = 25² − 20² = 625 − 400 = 225 → |AD| = 15 m</span></li> <li><b>|DE|’yi alanla bul</b> ABD dik üçgeninin alanı iki şekilde yazılır: dik kenarlarla ve [AB] tabanıyla. <span class=\"sv-m\">(20 · 15) ÷ 2 = (25 · |DE|) ÷ 2</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">|DE| = 300 ÷ 25 = 12 m</span></li> <li><b>|DG|’yi bul</b> Şekil simetrik olduğundan |DG| = |DE| = 12 m.</li> <li><b>Topla</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">15 + 12 + 12 = 39 m</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 420 240\" width=\"420\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"İkizkenar çatı makası; AD 15, DE ve DG 12, BD ve DC 20, kenarlar 25\"><polygon points=\"210,70 30,205 390,205\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"205\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><polyline points=\"210,196 219,196 219,205\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"145.2\" y2=\"118.6\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><polyline points=\"150,125 156.4,120.2 151.6,113.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"274.8\" y2=\"118.6\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><polyline points=\"270,125 263.6,120.2 268.4,113.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"60.2\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">A</text><text x=\"15.4\" y=\"213.9\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">B</text><text x=\"404.6\" y=\"213.9\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">C</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"224.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">D</text><text x=\"133.2\" y=\"113.5\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0e7490\" font-weight=\"bold\">E</text><text x=\"286.8\" y=\"113.5\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0e7490\" font-weight=\"bold\">G</text><text x=\"84.6\" y=\"151.5\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" font-weight=\"bold\">25</text><text x=\"84.6\" y=\"151.5\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">25</text><text x=\"335.4\" y=\"151.5\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" font-weight=\"bold\">25</text><text x=\"335.4\" y=\"151.5\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">25</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"224.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">20</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"224.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">20</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"92.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#dc2626\" font-weight=\"bold\">15</text><text x=\"171.8\" y=\"177.5\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" font-weight=\"bold\">12</text><text x=\"171.8\" y=\"177.5\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0e7490\" font-weight=\"bold\">12</text><text x=\"248.2\" y=\"177.5\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" font-weight=\"bold\">12</text><text x=\"248.2\" y=\"177.5\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0e7490\" font-weight=\"bold\">12</text></svg><figcaption>Payandalar ABD ve ADC dik üçgenlerinin hipotenüse ait yükseklikleridir.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Dik üçgende hipotenüse ait yükseklik = dik kenarların çarpımı ÷ hipotenüs: 20 · 15 ÷ 25 = 12.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Payandaları 15 sanan 45, 10 sanan 35 bulur; 40 ise tabanın uzunluğudur.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>B</b></div></div>"
